('0d453cbc6bb40b370d5b1a94ff0974a114374f49d40f6d9bdb573850cbd55d38','en','Persons with hearing disabilities aged 60 or younger who received surgery support through the Gyeonggi-do cochlear implant surgery project'),
('0d453cbc6bb40b370d5b1a94ff0974a114374f49d40f6d9bdb573850cbd55d38','zh','通过京畿道人工耳蜗手术项目获得手术支持的60岁以下听障人士'),
