('7f17011314c278f73c5753ba9446fc59ccf9982d934500a3ea9206fcac454681','en','In person - Daeya Day Care Center for Persons with Disabilities\nBy phone - 031-404-8110 \nWebsite: http://www.dywelfare.or.kr/'),
