('f337f77795bae8d8cd3983a06efc5df03233bbf27874f19e4d99923728527f0f','en','Collected from Bokjiro API (2026) — Target: A person whose father or mother has been registered as a resident of the city and has lived there for at least 180 days before the child\'s birth registration date / A guide with the same name also exists in other sources (guidebook, Bokjiro) — the target (first child/second child, etc.), applicable year, and amount may differ, so check with the responsible department'),
