('b0a4499198bab7d08a06257ea2d50713fefbd0910644cfa7279da4c885f6d036','en','Supports transportation costs for seniors aged 65 or older living in Siheung. To guarantee transportation welfare and mobility rights of seniors aged 65 or older in Siheung, part of their transportation costs is supported to make it easier to use public transportation (buses).'),
