('8e34778aa6ccd7a0a6f43072c758301bbd38ca344d967cd0bc3aa450b86bc559','en','Contributes to improving the quality of life of persons with disabilities by running a rehabilitation health room that offers rehabilitation programs and customized rehabilitation services for each type of disability'),
('8e34778aa6ccd7a0a6f43072c758301bbd38ca344d967cd0bc3aa450b86bc559','zh','通过运营康复保健室,开展面向残疾人的康复项目,并按残疾类型提供定制康复服务,从而提高残疾人的生活质量'),
