('d869ede0bdf72fc0874c203df636d5beeda1c829502cef9f75b6ccd242ba85d6','en','- Online: Social Service Electronic Voucher website (www.socialservice.or.kr) -> After applying, mail the required documents to the Korea Social Security Information Service within 15 days'),
