('6807c86e9d9b4418987ae95af29994fbdc39a00af811eefbd7bf8260c48f449a','en','○ Support for buying agricultural machinery\n - Supports the purchase cost of machinery listed in the government-supported agricultural machinery catalog\n - Subsidy of up to 35% of the purchase price (adjustable)\n - There is an upper limit  ※ Limit: KRW 7 million (under KRW 50 million), KRW 10 million (KRW 50 million or more)'),
