('796749d64f1241785f72f132aa40e6968f2a534228a59e044582f1b8f9bff365','en','Provides cash equal to 1.5% of the outstanding housing jeonse loan balance (up to 700,000 won) to qualifying newlywed households within 7 years of marriage who have lived in the city for at least 1 month'),
