('49ff616d9d8eed0dad58946fd801dd01954a60c19346979f2c6eff4f6245d0bb','en','Vulnerable people facing a sudden crisis\ne.g., risk of eviction, electricity or gas cut-off, unpaid monthly rent, lack of money for hospital bills, etc.\nEmergency support funds are paid to households in crisis\nWhether support is possible is confirmed according to the review result of the Community Social Security Council'),
