('e031a9354ad078f1fcdeaaebccdb81f5f9ebed09f73e6be144a51ad4ecb9f636','en','Collected via Subsidy24 (Bojogeum24) (2026) — Target: ○ Persons with disabilities registered in the city, or seniors aged 65 or older, who use powered mobility aids (electric wheelchairs and scooters) / The target is "registered persons with disabilities OR people aged 65 or older" (either/or) — meeting either one is enough; needs confirmation'),
