('00e346b1c6ffc724d8e7d05b3fba8b39de31161eecc0734ed306508c9bcaf81a','en','All men and women aged 20~49 who wish to be tested (regardless of marriage or children)\nSupport once per main cycle, up to 3 times\n* Age 29 or under (1st cycle), 30~34 (2nd cycle), 35~49 (3rd cycle)\n*Couples (including engaged couples and common-law couples) among men and women aged 15~19 are supported'),
