('548b1fe2febc74db867410ab269b719e650ed7b01c3864b20bece9413022b847','en','1) When applying in person\n<Form No. 1> Application for Customized Care Service for Older Adults\nApplicant\'s ID\n\n2) When applying by proxy\n<Form No. 1> Application form\nApplicant\'s ID\nPower of attorney and the proxy applicant\'s ID'),
