('e08327404dd122934e9e5bdfe354e55d46de7216824edbc7749bb743912d3b49','en','Among households at 140% or less of the standard median income or basic pension recipients:\n① People aged 60 or older with a musculoskeletal, nervous system, or circulatory system disease\n② Registered persons with physical or brain lesion disabilities\n③ Among people graded as wounded under the Act on Honorable Treatment of Persons of National Merit, those with a musculoskeletal, nervous system, or circulatory system disease'),
