('72fc44dc34b36fb8b88ff78591d0c9d86954269c62b5c2140bf5a7590f820092','en','Data collected from Bokjiro API (2026) — Eligibility: - Rehabilitation therapy for children with disabilities: persons with intellectual, autism spectrum, visual, hearing, speech, or brain lesion disabilities under age 18 (for infants and toddlers under age 9, if a disability is expected, a developmental rehabilitation service referral and test data may be submitted instead)- Other rehabilitation programs: persons with intellectual, autism spectrum, visual, hearing, speech, or brain lesion disabilities under age 60'),
('72fc44dc34b36fb8b88ff78591d0c9d86954269c62b5c2140bf5a7590f820092','zh','福利路(Bokjiro) API 收集内容(2026) — 对象：- 残疾儿童康复治疗：未满18岁的智力、自闭症、视力、听力、语言、脑病变残疾人（但婴幼儿（未满9岁）若预见可能出现残疾，可用发育康复服务转介书及检查资料代替）- 其他康复项目：未满60岁的智力、自闭症、视力、听力、语言、脑病变残疾人'),
