('f6fd6e19f4a831ae2cf70bf59473910cca083adca7ae36cef45111169b07b34a','en','None \n(Basic Livelihood Security recipients, persons of national merit, people aged 65 or older, persons with disabilities, families with many children (2 or more children, youngest aged 18 or under), single-parent family protection recipients, people injured or killed while helping others and their bereaved families, May 18 Democratic Merit persons and their families, military service honor families, residents of social welfare facilities, and blood donors under Siheung City ordinance - 50% tuition discount)'),
