('e5edf2f7f714426a8ba29b92d07f2b260f75ebdfc056b5ebe0917657c37e5970','en','1) Youth aged 9 to 24\n2) Youth subject to educational guidance who need support to prevent delinquency and deviant behavior\n3) Out-of-school youth\n4) Youth who have no guardian or who do not actually receive care from a guardian\n5) Withdrawn (reclusive) youth\n6) Income at 100% or less of the median income'),
