('ee9cbfb2f23175f29f2c0284400883a982e5aa0bf8c850516d659781e39d295a','en','1) Youth Basic Income payment application form,\n2) Consent form for provision and use of personal information,\n3) Extract of resident registration (abstract): only those issued within the application period are accepted\n- Must include address change details, date of occurrence, report date, reason for change, and the last digits of the resident registration number'),
