('31366071892550c8c98287f3adcc79e4c4a8358fce3665764fa7bbd7ae397eaf','en','- In person: Visit the relevant Nanum-teo at any time\n(except lunch time, 13:00~14:00)\n - Online: Apply for a program at Siheung Family Center (https://shcity.familynet.or.kr/center/index.do)\n  * Band: https://band.us/@mokgam9'),
('31366071892550c8c98287f3adcc79e4c4a8358fce3665764fa7bbd7ae397eaf','zh','- 现场办理:随时前往相应的分享站(Nanum-teo)\n(午餐时间13:00~14:00除外)\n - 线上:在始兴市家庭中心(https://shcity.familynet.or.kr/center/index.do)申请项目\n  * Band:https://band.us/@mokgam9'),
