('20e1c0c91e685c13c97b6259bece847f44e40d43b9eada7536478cda4ab220ee','en','1) Medical certificate (stating final diagnosis, disease name, disease code, and date of diagnosis)\n2) Copy of the patient\'s bankbook\n3) ID card\n4) Medical expense receipt and medicine expense receipt\n  * Can be omitted if you agree to the shared use of administrative information under the Electronic Government Act'),
