('0f556678b881eca82a7f7ef6b52faccaf39de379e07498dd8cc6799c681eb331','en','Those who meet both of the following: 1) The 3-generation family members must have lived together at an address in Siheung continuously for 5 years or more 2) The 1st generation must be aged 70 or older. A 3-generation household that has lived together continuously for 5 years or more in the city with direct ascendants aged 70 or older and direct descendants'),
