('d8c1936c03569f6a20279f8e39a41a1b7cc66815baa52ed92f9983baca1a653d','en','Provides meals to low-income seniors aged 60 or older in the area\n\n*Senior Restaurant free meals: Seniors who can move around visit in person to eat (5 times a week)\n*Meal delivery for low-income seniors living at home: Side dishes are delivered to seniors who cannot move around (3 times a week)'),
