('bce7a050788ab6ce0cd5d376709bccfc5b3e35ea3506b6531c5ce7db9261d653','en','Provides daytime protection and care services for adults with intellectual and developmental disabilities, and offers specialized programs to promote social participation and build a foundation for independence.\n* Programs provided: daily living support program, emotional learning support program, social adaptation training program, family support program, etc.'),
