('9f44af57555023eba398d022a162fa4a2e9fef95fc63c13b122d7c7742017dc9','en','1) Support application form, 1 copy\n2) Test fee receipt and itemized test fee statement, 1 copy each\n3) Copy of bankbook for the account to receive support funds, 1 copy\n4) Resident registration certificate, 1 copy*\n  ‐Recipients of National Basic Livelihood Security and near-poor households may replace it with a relevant certificate or confirmation document\n    * May be omitted if you consent to confirmation through shared use of administrative information under the Electronic Government Act\n6) (Confirmatory test fee) Supporting documents for confirmed diagnosis, such as a medical certificate')
