('792fc7ffe2d937c49f5e6cb89787a8b06d484fb92cca614ff52195d82271cae2','en','Income criteria: income of 80% or less of the standard median income, a rental/lease deposit and officially assessed value of owned home of KRW 150 million or less, and deposits, savings, and stocks totaling KRW 7 million or less, among recipients of Basic Livelihood Security, near-poor households, and other low-income households (non-recipients) in the city: those for whom a caregiver service is unavoidable'),
