('cf115c272634ce4c3a194469e06b858ccf19fe9e4e482a66c3b1a7834a90632b','en','1) Women aged 20 to 49 whose resident registration address is in Siheung as of the application date\n2) Ovarian function test value (AMH) of 1.5ng/ml or less\n3) 180% or less of standard median income\n※ Eligibility must be maintained until the final support payment is received'),
