('017b021002786a7333719aaefeabdbbd701eeb6c8f25f7250d209dd9cd52ad0d','en','Finds eligible migrant-background youth through linkage with local resources, and provides tailored services by region and field.\n*Learning (education) support: Korean language, basic academic skills, bilingual education, qualification exam (GED) preparation, instructor dispatch, etc.\n*Independence (career) support: career experience activities, employment programs (obtaining certificates), etc.\n*Activity support: cultural experiences, leisure activities, etc.'),
