('4aff4e12507b170a0eb32447fd130048856c57898d7d2c8538f52c14d525b75a','en','Supports low-income older adult households living in semi-basements or old houses in Sinchon-dong that need housing improvement, with housing safety inspection, replacement of old switches, replacement with eco-friendly high-efficiency LED lights, and installation of automatic gas shut-off devices.'),
