('50b2fd2e2c206b6a1443878492a27dcaf66541e17638f91cba524b4162495b46','en','Treatment cost support application form\nOne of: a medical certificate stating the disease code (stating the first diagnosis date for initial diagnosis), a medical opinion, or a prescription\nResident registration certificate (full/abstract copy)\nOriginal medical receipt from a psychiatry department\nDetailed itemized statement if needed\nAdmission confirmation for emergency administrative hospitalization\nHealth insurance eligibility certificate / premium payment certificate\nCopy of bank account book, copy of ID\nBusiness registration certificate if payment is made to a medical institution'),
