('dca0a8ca8496be59c7789dfdf78c293b38f9d5fa07e47cc189e6ff8abfc51f39','en','Helps couples prepare for childbirth by providing pregnancy planning tests to couples who are planning to become pregnant, before or after marriage.\n- Test items: 19 types in total (urine test, blood test, x-ray)'),
