('0e031cf231580cb1a886e6fc65b1fe0f8c9090f037751de5dd9511e9bbf2ca71','zh','改善并稳定饮食生活\n（每周3天，提供6餐）'),
('0e031cf231580cb1a886e6fc65b1fe0f8c9090f037751de5dd9511e9bbf2ca71','vi','Cải thiện và ổn định chế độ ăn uống\n(3 ngày mỗi tuần, cung cấp 6 bữa)'),
('dfe3b830cb389a2c5a8031ebaa1b23bd4bcf0cb75f9e6cce96472418f8791787','en','For users selected through an independence support planning meeting after a cognitive rehabilitation assessment, an individualized plan is set up for activities to improve cognitive learning ability and social skills'),
