('9770f16c04e1dc6b176d2afab38c9b42e7356a84c2de0b246e1a800177b4cc50','en','○ Eligible users - Siheung citizens who need care ※ Others are supported through city review ○ Eligibility criteria - Must meet all three of the following conditions · Has difficulty moving alone or performing daily life independently · Has no family or others who can provide care, or they are unable to do so · Does not use public care services, or there is an unavoidable gap while using services'),
